{
  "id": 5644,
  "title": "渐进式生成对抗网络 (ProGAN)",
  "meta_title": "渐进式生成对抗网络 (ProGAN)",
  "meta_description": "理解用于高分辨率图像合成的逐层训练。",
  "content": "<p>直接使用标准生成对抗网络 (GAN) 生成 1024x1024 像素等高分辨率图像，会带来显著的训练难题。随着网络深度和图像尺寸的增加，梯度可能变得不稳定，导致发散或收敛缓慢。此外，生成器可能难以从一开始就同时学习粗略结构和精细细节。由 Karras 等人（NVIDIA）提出的渐进式生成对抗网络 (ProGAN) 方法，通过在训练过程中逐步提高任务复杂度，提供了一种巧妙的解决方案。</p>\n<p>ProGAN 的主要思路是，首先使用极低分辨率图像（例如 4x4 像素）开始训练生成器 (G) 和判别器 (D)，然后逐渐向两个网络添加新层，以处理更高分辨率（8x8、16x16，…，直到 1024x1024 或更高）。这种递增的方法使网络能够首先在低分辨率下学习图像分布的大尺度结构，随后将重心转向更精细的细节，随着分辨率的提高而调整。</p>\n<h3>增长过程</h3>\n<p>训练从一个简单的生成器和判别器对开始，它们处理低分辨率图像（例如 4x4）。一旦这对初始网络显示出收敛和稳定的迹象，就会为 G 和 D 添加新层，以使图像分辨率翻倍（例如，从 4x4 变为 8x8）。</p>\n<p>重要的是，这种转换并非突然。新添加的层会在一段训练迭代期内平滑地“淡入”。这是通过使用参数 (parameter) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span> 实现的，其范围从 0 到 1。当添加新的层块（处理更高分辨率）时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>在生成器中：</strong> 先前分辨率块的输出进行上采样，并计算新块的输出（该输出也以上采样特征作为输入）。最终输出是加权组合：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>新输出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>上采样旧输出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{新输出}) \\times \\alpha + (\\text{上采样旧输出}) \\times (1 - \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新输出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上采样旧输出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>在判别器中：</strong> 输入图像由新层处理，结果被下采样。输入图像也会直接下采样并由先前分辨率块处理。判别器使用这两条路径的加权组合：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>来自新层</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>来自下采样后旧层</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{来自新层}) \\times \\alpha + (\\text{来自下采样后旧层}) \\times (1 - \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">来自新层</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">来自下采样后旧层</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span> 逐渐从 0 增加到 1。最初（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>），新层没有影响，网络像在先前分辨率下一样运行。随着 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span> 的增加，新层的贡献增加，使网络能够平稳适应更高分辨率任务。一旦 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，旧的连接路径被有效地移除，网络完全以新的、更高分辨率运行。此过程会随着后续分辨率的提高而重复。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-17vhofb\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph G {\n  rankdir=TB;\n  node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=\"sans-serif\", fontsize=10];\n  edge [fontname=\"sans-serif\", fontsize=9];\n\n  subgraph cluster_4x4 {\n    label = \"阶段 1: 4x4\";\n    bgcolor=\"#e9ecef\";\n    G₄ [label=\"G (4x4)\", shape=cylinder, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n    D₄ [label=\"D (4x4)\", shape=cylinder, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n    z [label=\"z (潜在变量)\", shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\"];\n    real_4 [label=\"真实图像 (4x4)\", shape=box, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffe066\"];\n    z -> G₄;\n    G₄ -> D₄ [label=\"生成图像 (4x4)\"];\n    real_4 -> D₄;\n  }\n\n  subgraph cluster_8x8_fade {\n    label = \"阶段 2: 8x8 淡入 (α → 1)\";\n    bgcolor=\"#e9ecef\";\n    G_4_fade [label=\"G 模块 (4x4)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n    G_8_fade [label=\"G 模块 (8x8)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\"];\n    D_4_fade [label=\"D 模块 (4x4)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n    D_8_fade [label=\"D 模块 (8x8)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n    z_fade [label=\"z\", shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\"];\n    real_8 [label=\"真实图像 (8x8)\", shape=box, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffd43b\"];\n\n    # 生成器路径\n    z_fade -> G_4_fade;\n    G_4_fade -> G_8_fade [label=\"上采样\"];\n    G_4_fade -> merge_G [label=\"上采样, (1-α) 权重\", style=dashed];\n    G_8_fade -> merge_G [label=\"α 权重\", style=dashed];\n    merge_G [label=\"组合 (α)\", shape=circle, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#dee2e6\", width=0.3, height=0.3];\n\n    # 判别器路径\n    real_8 -> D_8_fade;\n    D_8_fade -> D_4_fade [label=\"下采样\"];\n    real_8 -> merge_D [label=\"下采样, (1-α) 权重\", style=dashed];\n    D_8_fade -> merge_D [label=\"α 权重\", style=dashed];\n    merge_D [label=\"组合 (α)\", shape=circle, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#dee2e6\", width=0.3, height=0.3];\n    merge_D -> D_4_fade;\n\n    # 连接到 D\n    merge_G -> merge_D_input [label=\"生成图像 (8x8)\"];\n    merge_D_input [label=\"D 输入\", shape=plaintext];\n    merge_D_input -> D_8_fade;\n  }\n\n  subgraph cluster_8x8_stable {\n    label = \"阶段 3: 稳定 8x8\";\n    bgcolor=\"#e9ecef\";\n    G_4_stable [label=\"G 模块 (4x4)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n    G_8_stable [label=\"G 模块 (8x8)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\"];\n    D_4_stable [label=\"D 模块 (4x4)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n    D_8_stable [label=\"D 模块 (8x8)\", style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n    z_stable [label=\"z\", shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\"];\n    real_8_stable [label=\"真实图像 (8x8)\", shape=box, style=filled, fillcolor=\"#ffd43b\"];\n\n    z_stable -> G_4_stable;\n    G_4_stable -> G_8_stable [label=\"上采样\"];\n    G_8_stable -> D_8_stable [label=\"生成图像 (8x8)\"];\n    D_8_stable -> D_4_stable [label=\"下采样\"];\n    real_8_stable -> D_8_stable;\n  }\n\n  # 阶段转换 (用于布局的不可见边)\n  G₄ -> G_4_fade [style=invis];\n  D₄ -> D_4_fade [style=invis];\n  G_4_fade -> G_4_stable [style=invis];\n  D_4_fade -> D_4_stable [style=invis];\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-17vhofb\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>图示 ProGAN 训练阶段。最初（阶段 1），G 和 D 在低分辨率（4x4）下运行。在阶段 2，添加用于 8x8 分辨率的新层，并使用参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span> 淡入。在阶段 3，淡入完成后（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>），8x8 网络得到稳定训练。此过程会随着更高分辨率的提升而重复。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>支持稳定性和质量的技术</h3>\n<p>ProGAN 采用了一些额外技术，以进一步提升训练稳定性和图像质量，尤其是在更高分辨率下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>小批量标准差：</strong> 为了应对模式崩溃（即生成器只生成种类有限的样本），通常在判别器末端添加一个小批量标准差层。该层计算当前小批量中所有空间位置和样本的特征标准差。然后将此统计数据平均并复制到一个额外的特征图中，该特征图与原始特征拼接。通过向判别器提供关于批量统计的信息，如果生成器产生变化异常低的批量，判别器可以隐式地对其进行惩罚，从而鼓励样本多样性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>均衡学习率：</strong> 标准的权重 (weight)初始化方案（如 Xavier 或 He）并非总能阻止梯度在非常深的神经网络 (neural network)中爆炸或消失，尤其是在激活函数 (activation function)或架构不同时。ProGAN 采用<em>均衡学习率</em>，这是一种动态权重缩放形式。在运行时，在每次通过卷积层或全连接层的前向或反向传播 (backpropagation)之前，权重 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会按因子 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> 进行缩放：\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{w}_i = w_i / c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span>\n这里，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> 是一个逐层归一化 (normalization)常数，通常根据 He 初始化器的原理计算：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mtext>扇入</mtext></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\text{扇入}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.6049em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2351em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">扇入</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1951em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"></path></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6049em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>扇入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{扇入}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">扇入</span></span></span></span></span> 是层的输入连接数。这种缩放确保了输出（和梯度）的方差在各层之间大致保持不变，无论连接数或参数 (parameter)尺度如何，有效地均衡了所有权重的学习速度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>像素归一化：</strong> 应用于生成器中每个卷积层之后（激活函数之前）。此技术将每个像素 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 处的特征向量 (vector)归一化为单位长度：\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{x,y} = \\frac{a_{x,y}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{j=0}^{N-1} (a_{x,y}^j)^2 + \\epsilon}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"